  "question": {
    "text": "The escape velocity for a body projected vertically upwards from the surface of earth is $11 \\mathrm{~km} / \\mathrm{s}$. If the body is projected at an angle of $45^{\\circ}$ with the vertical, the escape velocity will be",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
